---
description: Icelandic full name for a woman: one given name and a patronymic (Anna Einarsdóttir). The second element takes -dóttir, not -son, so a brother and sister with the same father are Jón Einarsson and Anna Einarsdóttir — different second names, same family. Nothing is inherited and nothing is shared, which is why Iceland alphabetises by the given name.
generator: tdc
locale: is
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="is.person.female.firstName"/>
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="is.person.female.lastName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.f}} ${{p.l}}</data>
